      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIWARD.\nWhat wood is this before us?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132622/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132622/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 36,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3696814,
        "end": 3696880,
        "line": 136362,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@132622",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SIWARD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132692",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENTEITH.\nThe wood of Birnam.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132692/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132692/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 29,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3696884,
        "end": 3696943,
        "line": 136367,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@132692",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENTEITH.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132755",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MALCOLM.\nLet every soldier hew him down a bough,\nAnd bear’t before him. Thereby shall we shadow\nThe numbers of our host, and make discovery\nErr in report of us.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132755/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132755/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132755/line-3",
          "start": 49,
          "end": 95,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132755/line-4",
          "start": 96,
          "end": 139,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132755/line-5",
          "start": 140,
          "end": 160,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3696947,
        "end": 3697152,
        "line": 136372,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@132755",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MALCOLM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132964",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOLDIERS.\nIt shall be done.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132964/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@132964/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 27,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3697156,
        "end": 3697213,
        "line": 136380,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@132964",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOLDIERS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133025",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIWARD.\nWe learn no other but the confident tyrant\nKeeps still in Dunsinane, and will endure\nOur setting down before’t.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133025/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133025/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 50,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133025/line-3",
          "start": 51,
          "end": 92,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133025/line-4",
          "start": 93,
          "end": 119,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3697217,
        "end": 3697376,
        "line": 136385,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@133025",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SIWARD.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133188",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MALCOLM.\n’Tis his main hope;\nFor where there is advantage to be given,\nBoth more and less have given him the revolt,\nAnd none serve with him but constrained things,\nWhose hearts are absent too.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133188/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133188/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 28,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133188/line-3",
          "start": 29,
          "end": 70,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133188/line-4",
          "start": 71,
          "end": 116,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133188/line-5",
          "start": 117,
          "end": 164,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133188/line-6",
          "start": 165,
          "end": 193,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3697380,
        "end": 3697623,
        "line": 136392,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@133188",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MALCOLM.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133435",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MACDUFF.\nLet our just censures\nAttend the true event, and put we on\nIndustrious soldiership.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133435/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 8,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133435/line-2",
          "start": 9,
          "end": 30,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133435/line-3",
          "start": 31,
          "end": 67,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133435/line-4",
          "start": 68,
          "end": 92,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 3697627,
        "end": 3697759,
        "line": 136401,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap20/p@133435",
        "anchor": "sceneV_20.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MACDUFF.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "macbeth/sceneV_20.4/p@133571",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SIWARD.\nThe time approaches,\nThat will with due decision make us know\nWhat we shall say we have, and what we owe.\nThoughts speculative their unsure hopes relate,\nBut certain issue strokes must arbitrate;\nTowards which advance the war.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
